00:07:51.127 --> 00:07:52.985
- I know, and you also
feel guilty about that.

00:07:52.985 --> 00:07:53.818
- Yeah.

00:07:53.818 --> 00:07:55.087
- But this is when he started playing

00:07:55.087 --> 00:07:57.705
basketball and he's this, you know,

00:07:57.705 --> 00:07:59.946
he keeps like swearing off the

00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:01.435
performing gene in him.

00:08:01.435 --> 00:08:03.367
But what he would do is when
we were doing sound check

00:08:03.367 --> 00:08:06.515
with the lights and the band
is rocking and he would come

00:08:06.515 --> 00:08:08.604
out with the drummer, he'd do his handles

00:08:08.604 --> 00:08:10.783
to the beat with the drummer.

00:08:10.783 --> 00:08:11.756
- Oh, I love that.

00:08:11.756 --> 00:08:13.684
- And like, enjoy the lights coming on and

00:08:13.684 --> 00:08:15.516
they work off each other like jazz.

00:08:15.516 --> 00:08:16.636
But like, you know...

00:08:16.636 --> 00:08:17.469
- [Kelly] That's cool.

00:08:17.469 --> 00:08:19.295
- And so there's a, there's some scene

00:08:19.295 --> 00:08:20.756
like that that I think
is really beautiful.

00:08:20.756 --> 00:08:22.625
You see a silhouette
like this and I'm singing

00:08:22.625 --> 00:08:24.236
in the front, the
drummer's doing his thing

00:08:24.236 --> 00:08:25.684
and then he walks over and he just puts

00:08:25.684 --> 00:08:27.284
his head on me while I'm like trying

00:08:27.284 --> 00:08:28.996
to sing and give them sound...

00:08:28.996 --> 00:08:29.829
- Yeah.

00:08:29.829 --> 00:08:30.662
- Yeah so...

00:08:30.662 --> 00:08:31.495
- It's always cool, like it's important,

00:08:31.495 --> 00:08:32.513
I think, for our kids to see how,

00:08:32.513 --> 00:08:33.346
you know, how hard we work.

00:08:33.346 --> 00:08:34.353
- I think especially little boys to see

00:08:34.353 --> 00:08:36.839
like their moms, you know, being powerful

00:08:36.839 --> 00:08:39.636
and choosing to do what
they love as a passion

00:08:39.636 --> 00:08:41.564
and that's not a bad thing, you know?

00:08:41.564 --> 00:08:42.397
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:42.397 --> 00:08:44.644
- So I hope he picks a
really good woman one day.

00:08:44.644 --> 00:08:45.477
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:45.477 --> 00:08:46.310
- Or man, whatever.

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:47.143
- Yeah.

00:08:47.143 --> 00:08:47.976
- But like...

00:08:47.976 --> 00:08:48.809
- Yeah whatever he...

00:08:48.809 --> 00:08:49.642
- I have a feeling it's a woman,

00:08:49.642 --> 00:08:50.924
but I don't know and I don't care.

00:08:50.924 --> 00:08:53.241
- Okay, so do you, have
you ever felt like you've

00:08:53.241 --> 00:08:54.756
ever been pigeonholed musically?

00:08:54.756 --> 00:08:57.015
Because people kind of,
they get one sound from you

00:08:57.015 --> 00:08:58.276
and then they expect That I think

00:08:58.276 --> 00:08:59.924
really happens to a lot of us.

00:08:59.924 --> 00:09:02.236
