break the, no matter how

00:09:02.236 --> 00:09:05.535
many songs I do, I played Led
Zeppelin on my tour, you know?

00:09:05.535 --> 00:09:07.924
I have this whole side
to me, but people mostly

00:09:07.924 --> 00:09:09.645
