it doesn't matter how...

00:09:24.273 --> 00:09:25.639
(laughter)

00:09:25.639 --> 00:09:27.759
I could sing a duet with
you and it would still

00:09:27.759 --> 00:09:30.049
say, you know, something from Oklahoma,

00:09:30.049 --> 00:09:31.049
