00:09:39.217 --> 00:09:40.228
the rock and roll vibe.

00:09:40.228 --> 00:09:41.061
- [Idina] Yeah.

00:09:41.061 --> 00:09:41.894
- Yeah.

00:09:41.894 --> 00:09:43.414
- It's just my, I'm gonna
head bang when, like,

00:09:43.414 --> 00:09:45.262
as I'm getting older, I
feel like it gets harder

00:09:45.262 --> 00:09:47.036
and harder to convince
people that I can do this.

00:09:47.036 --> 00:09:48.276
Especially if it hurts my neck.

00:09:48.276 --> 00:09:50.919
- See, I think it's, I think
it's easier the older I get.

00:09:50.919 --> 00:09:53.049
I feel like because I
just, not that I like...

00:09:53.049 --> 00:09:53.882
- You don't care?

00:09:53.882 --> 00:09:55.276
- Cared so much when I was younger,

00:09:55.276 --> 00:09:56.948
it's just that like I
felt like we're forced to,

00:09:56.948 --> 00:09:58.559
like, people put on what
you're supposed to be doing

00:09:58.559 --> 00:09:59.996
and it's like, "Okay,
well I'm not trying to,

00:09:59.996 --> 00:10:01.948
