feathers" but then it's like,

00:10:01.948 --> 00:10:03.497
"No I like a lot of different things."

00:10:03.497 --> 00:10:04.330
Like I wonder whatever...

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.079
- Yeah like country, you
did that album when you

00:10:06.079 --> 00:10:07.919
