did more rock and roll

00:10:07.919 --> 00:10:08.817
and you did the pop...

00:10:08.817 --> 00:10:09.668
- I like a lot of stuff.

00:10:09.668 --> 00:10:10.501
- Yeah.

00:10:10.501 --> 00:10:11.334
- Yeah, I think a lot of singers...

00:10:11.334 --> 00:10:13.148
- And you trained from opera at first.

00:10:13.148 --> 00:10:14.009
- Yeah, yeah.

00:10:14.009 --> 00:10:14.842
- Yeah, so it's...

00:10:14.842 --> 00:10:17.132
- It is how people present,
how you're presented

00:10:17.132 --> 00:10:18.588
to the public though, and the first thing,

00:10:18.588 --> 00:10:19.628
it's hard to get outta that.

00:10:19.628 --> 00:10:20.669
- Yeah, it's really hard to get out of it.

00:10:20.669 --> 00:10:21.568
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:10:21.568 --> 00:10:22.583
Oh well, I think you're awesome.

00:10:22.583 --> 00:10:23.416
- Thank you, I think you're awesome.

00:10:23.416 --> 00:10:24.940
